Cell["14. Quantum Optics with QuantumInterferometer", "Section",
 CellID->1622616291,ExpressionUUID->"28023c0b-10a3-7000-5831-b655a156436a"],

Cell["\<\
Fourteen linear-optics experiments, each ending in a checked prediction. Fock \
amplitudes are permanents, squeezed amplitudes hafnians, and loss acts on \
probabilities directly.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1371263066,ExpressionUUID->"4f1b960d-0301-b7cd-7538-0857b6b51d17"],

Cell["\[NonBreakingSpace]", "SlideShowNavigationBar",
