Cell["15. A Formal Semantics for QuantumFramework", "Section",
 CellID->474827638,ExpressionUUID->"29094997-c9cb-f733-5f37-60d0e87fda19"],

Cell["\<\
What does a QF object mean? A coefficient array means nothing until its \
subsystem dimensions, its output/input split and its bases are fixed, and QF \
stores exactly those.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->480943277,ExpressionUUID->"284fc6fb-b6ce-6422-5874-dfa4c37b4f08"],

Cell["\[NonBreakingSpace]", "SlideShowNavigationBar",
 CellTags->"SlideShowHeader",
